#  Build & Bloom

### Plant Management Decision Support System in Pangasinan

Build & Bloom is a web-based **Plant Management Decision Support System** designed to help growers in Pangasinan make more informed planting decisions.

The system answers three main questions:

> **What can I grow here?**
> **Can I grow it successfully?**
> **How can I take care of it?**

Instead of simply recommending crops, Build & Bloom considers factors such as **location, soil, water, sunlight, temperature, season, growing environment, and weather** to provide more meaningful planting recommendations.

